{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2486691beba91c4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view in the Dashboard (side-by-side and diff)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view in the Dashboard (side-by-side and diff)\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDeliver a run comparison view in the Dashboard: users select two or more\n34\ttraining and pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side,\n35\tincluding a diff presentation that highlights which parameters and metrics\n36\tchanged between two selected runs. This gives data scientists in-platform\n37\tvisibility into what changed between candidate runs, replacing the current\n38\texport-to-spreadsheet workflow that model promotion decisions rely on.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Multi-select of two or more runs from the runs list in the Dashboard.\n43\t- Comparison view rendering parameters and metrics for all selected runs side\n44\t  by side, using the same run data already surfaced on the per-run pages.\n45\t- Diff mode for two selected runs: highlight which parameters and metrics\n46\t  changed between them.\n47\t- Support for both training runs and pipeline runs, including runs executed\n48\t  via Data Science Pipelines.\n49\t- Respect the strategy's out-of-scope boundaries: no automatic best-run\n50\t  selection or promotion, and no comparison across clusters or across\n51\t  projects.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- A user can select two or more runs from the runs list and open the\n56\t  comparison view showing those runs' parameters and metrics side by side.\n57\t- Given two selected runs, the comparison view highlights which parameters and\n58\t  metrics changed between them (diff presentation).\n59\t- Comparison works for training runs and for pipeline runs executed via Data\n60\t  Science Pipelines, with parameters and metrics consistent with what the\n61\t  per-run pages show (passive-component validation for Data Science\n62\t  Pipelines).\n63\t- Comparison is scoped within a single project; no cross-cluster or\n64\t  cross-project comparison is offered.\n65\t- No automatic best-run selection or promotion behavior is introduced.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-1 (P0): select two or more runs and view parameters and metrics side by\n70\t  side in the Dashboard.\n71\t- HLR-3 (P1): run diff view highlighting which parameters and metrics changed\n72\t  between two selected runs — consolidated with HLR-1 as one capability; the\n73\t  diff view is a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the\n74\t  same run data, so it is covered by this epic rather than split out.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9381891f2a764639","agent_id":"a72b9122ee5648073","session_id":"e5b4410a-af76-4919-bbd4-4d16b5058733","uuid":"2533d8c9-f757-4a9f-8ed7-57a97b1aaeb9","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:02:43.827Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2486691beba91c4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
